#34061
The Plaza~
The buildings come to an end and the streets open into a huge circular plaza.
Through the water, you can see the remnants in the plaza of flagstoe paving in
an intricate sunburst design.  In the center of the plaza, the river is joined
by another stream rushing in from the north.  They forms a small whirlpool as
the water meets and swirls before joining and continues west between another
group of tumble-down buildings.  Here, light streams into the plaza from a
crack in the cavern roof hundreds of feet above, illuminating the ghostly mist,
dancing off the surface of the water whenever the mist parted.    
~
